  "releaseNotes": "Vali-TimeZone v1.1.0 — ValiZoneInfo is now a record (structural equality), its custom ToString() preserved unchanged. Add net10.0 target. No breaking changes.\n\n            Vali-TimeZone v1.0.0 — initial release: ValiTimeZone class with Convert, ToUtc, FromUtc, GetOffset, IsDst, FindZone, AllZones, ZonesForCountry, IsValidZone, Now, Today, IsSameInstant, FormatWithZone, and DateTimeOffset interoperability.",
